<title>JAPAN: Moody's rates Swedish Export Credit samurai Aa3.</title>
<headline>Moody's rates Swedish Export Credit samurai Aa3.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said it had assigned an Aa3 rating to Swedish Export Credit Corp's (SEK) 15 billion yen 5.8 percent yen/Australian dollar dual-currency samurai bonds due on October 28, 1999.</p>
<p>The coupon of the bond will be paid in yen, while redemption will be in Australian dollars.</p>
</text>
